msgstr "Configure the Zhipu GLM (BigModel) API. Set the API key here."

msgid "默认"
msgstr "Default"

msgid "默认通用规范：rem 字体系统、1.5 行高、圆角、响应式基准、CSS 变量。可编辑或重新上传覆盖。"
msgstr "Default generic spec: rem font scale, 1.5 line height, border radii, responsive baselines, CSS variables. Edit or re-upload to override."

